### Why a command typed beside a running vigil cannot be handed to it. Each is said
### after "is keeping the vigil here, and".

typed-kept-meet = it looks for people only where it always does.
    Leave --meet out, or run this when it has stopped.
typed-kept-pack = a node is packed only while nothing is keeping it. Nothing was
    written. Stop the vigil, then pack it.
typed-kept-moved = where a node lives is said while nothing is keeping it. Stop the
    vigil, then run this again.
typed-kept-languages = it reads the catalogs, not the vigil.
typed-kept-service = it asks the service manager, not the vigil.
